      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "8836031"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Interacts with the GAP domain of NF1 (PubMed:8836031). Interacts (via TPR repeats) with HSP90AA1 and HSPA8 (PubMed:15708368). Interacts with GNA15 regardless of its activation state (PubMed:12748287, PubMed:20639119, PubMed:21486497). Interacts with HRAS (PubMed:12748287). Interacts with SOS2 (PubMed:20639119). Interacts with HSP40/DNAJB1 and HSP70/HSPA1A (PubMed:14503850)"
    }
   ],
